  "content": "[Intro]\n[F5]\n\n[Refrain]\n[F5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F5]Like most babies smell like butter\nHis smell smelled like no other\nHe was born scentless and senseless\nHe was born a scentless apprentice\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[B5]  [C#5]\n[Eb5]  [E5]\n[Gb5]  [Ab5]  [B5]\n[Ab5]Go\n\n[Chorus]\n[F5]away\nget away,\nget away,\n\n[Refrain]\n[F5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F5]Every wet nurse refused to feed him\nE-\nlectrolytes smell like semen\nI\npromise not to sell your perfumed secrets\nThere are\ncountless formulas for pressing flowers\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[B5]  [C#5]\n[Eb5]  [E5]\n[Gb5]  [Ab5]  [B5]\n[Ab5]Go\n\n[Chorus]\n[F5]away\nget away,\nget away,\n\n[Solo]\n[F5]\n\n[Refrain]\n[F5]\nI\n\n[Verse 3]\n[F5]lie in the soll and fertilize mushrooms\nLea-\nking out gas fumes made into perfume\nYou can't fire me because I quit\nThrow me in the fire I won't throw a fit\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[B5]  [C#5]\n[Eb5]  [E5]\n[Gb5]  [Ab5]  [B5]\n[Ab5]Go\n\n[Chorus]\n[F5]away\nget away,\nget away,\nget away,\nget away,\nget away,",
